  Now we have complete, verified understanding of `src/tree.h` AST structure, including:
  1. Standard header prefix for all nodes (polymorphic union `union node`).
  2. Linked list mechanism (`next` pointer and helper macros like `tree_link`, `tree_unshift`, `tree_move`, `tree_skip`, `tree_init`).
  3. Categorized list of node kinds (`enum kind`):
     - Command / Control flow nodes (Simple command, pipeline, not, and/or list, subshell, brace group, for loop, case & case nodes, if conditional, while/until loop, function, list)
     - Word & Expansion nodes (arg, assign, redir, argstr, argcmd, argparam, argarith)
